   "bound_to": {
    "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
    "title": {
     "zh": "参考值（逐字抄录，待比较记录）",
     "en": "Reference values (transcribed verbatim; awaiting a comparison record)"
    },
    "comment": [
     "源文档「5 MA L-mode — core/edge/divertor state」最后一帧的表值。★这是**边界的**判据，不是芯部的：本仓连边界都没有，所以它眼下是一份**记下来待有能力再比**的参考，不是可评的验收。",
     "| field | value |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| outer_upstream_J38 | Te/Ti = 26.3 / 46.4 eV; ne = 0.50e13 cm^-3 |\n| inner_upstream_J52 | Te/Ti = 27.9 / 45.9 eV; ne = 0.47e13 cm^-3 |\n| outer_target | Te/Ti = 0.96 / 1.00 eV; ne = 2.08e13 cm^-3 |\n| inner_target | Te/Ti = 1.18 / 1.23 eV; ne = 2.29e13 cm^-3 |\n| power_channels_MW | Pout / Pin / Prad = 0.117 / 0.110 / 0.414 |\n| energy_residual_MW | ion / electron = 4.76e-4 / 1.71e-3 |\n| particle_residual_over_source | 5.7e-9 |\n| counts | 267 JETTO outputs; 16 EIRENE calls; core snapshot ~295.788 s |\n| verdict | INCOMPLETE — EDGE2D TIME = 3.510495 s, time-step stiffness; 作业 101624 / 101723，源文档判为**未完全通过** |"
    ]
   }
  }
 ],
 "caveat": {
  "zh": [
   "SOL / 偏滤器的二维等离子体流体输运（EDGE2D 那一档）——本仓没有",
   "蒙特卡洛中性粒子与原子分子过程（EIRENE）——本仓没有",
   "芯—边交换与同步（COCONUT）——本仓没有"
  ],
  "en": [
   "Two-dimensional plasma-fluid transport in the SOL and divertor (EDGE2D) -- this repository has none",
   "Monte-Carlo neutrals and atomic/molecular processes (EIRENE) -- none",
   "Core-edge exchange and synchronization (COCONUT) -- none"
  ]
 },
